{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "658ed7a2359d133edf0a7bec0187d25d4b383756753fe8cc38fbe2d1f7352123", "ja": "嗚呼奥深き淑女道", "zh": "呜呼深奥之淑女道", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "292b083d5ce555ace0855669b361cab7702eb7bcac1a390728ef55e706285115", "ja": "淑女の立ち振る舞いの勉強会がスタート。\n伊織の厳しい指導に悲鳴をあげつつも着々と\n実力をつけていくアイドル達。理想の令嬢像\nを想像するなど色々な観点から、作品への\nモチベーションをより高めていくのだった。", "zh": "淑女举止的学习会正式开始。\n偶像们一边在伊织严格的指导下连连叫苦，一边稳步提升着\n自己的实力。她们从想象理想千金小姐的形象等各种角度出发，\n进一步提升了对作品的积极性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f45e9f20179d610e786e493d77b13447840c3298d161df8433a1b136b8f2d4c", "ja": "（オーディションの結果発表から数日後。伊織の指導\nの下、淑女の立ち振る舞いを学ぶ勉強会が開かれた）", "zh": "（试镜结果公布几天后。在伊织的指导下，举行了学习淑女举止的研习会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "ab1539cf5f72be60f91378fd22dffee9addf98af30333513708440d9bbf06ed3", "ja": "いい？　立ち姿ひとつとっても、\n相手の印象はガラッと変わるものなの。", "zh": "听好了？仅仅是一个站姿，\n给对方留下的印象就会彻底改变哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "ca5a6cce71a1e6e4461c3839bbcfc82d4c3e68d9e03212170b79dcbf56a797b9", "ja": "衣装がドレスの静香と可奈は、なおさらよ！\nまずは基本の姿勢を覚えておくところからね。", "zh": "穿着礼裙的静香和可奈就更要注意了！先从记住基本姿势开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "1daeb356d648532c123423bd960f280ec6f69fe6ce6b4756fc7b5c1d15e65fbe", "ja": "って、可奈！　もう背筋が曲がってる！\n顎も、もうちょっと引きなさい。こう！", "zh": "等等，可奈！你的背已经弯了！\n下巴也再收一点。像这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "7893c382c9614d281331798bd588676a3f024fe8397c6ad58336bdc2041c717b", "ja": "ひゃいっ！？\nこっ、こう、ですかぁ！？", "zh": "呀！？\n这、这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "40db593bc9ebe38e2b9b27235f9868f27cbb07d0b4b48cb85e7aa5bf8fc5aac8", "ja": "あら、やればできるじゃない！　そのままキープよ。\n骨盤が前後に動かないように、注意するといいわ。", "zh": "哎呀，这不是做得到嘛！就这样保持住。\n注意别让骨盆前后晃动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "7d9f2c7c42dc99a2b61a07aa4bd48fbf6f7f63a8e88a53636e93b67732c2b53e", "ja": "むむむ……立っているだけなのに、\nこんなに大変だなんて～……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……明明只是站着，\n没想到竟然这么辛苦～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "0ed279edb9bc2ce0d3b3a1c2a9777fd5dd981fe76149cf49910e8e7345ff0c1a", "ja": "静香は硬くなりすぎ。もうすこしリラックスして。\nあと重心は、後ろじゃなく土踏まずの辺りを意識よ。", "zh": "静香，你太紧绷了。再放松一点。\n还有，重心别放在后面，要注意放在脚掌的足弓附近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "4d4b548f94df7577aa1a9f3b223f840fb71d1423c36877fdf4bbc77a37c43ba0", "ja": "はっ、はい！", "zh": "啊，是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "845a734624aeb44a2c795c8b4349dc7099f115788d3dea612f6824bae1252239", "ja": "って、さらに硬くなってどうするのよ！\nエレガントさを演出するんだから、自然体よ、自然体！", "zh": "你、你怎么反而变得更僵硬了啊！要营造优雅感，就得保持自然，保持自然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "a5fb5d3c15907cfcaaa9baf6967311d001b9f189f3d8a9e7f4e82396d8e9a9dc", "ja": "す、すみません！　こうでしょうか……！", "zh": "对、对不起！这样可以吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "ea69e8a097c63e2beac01cf670ef58b901a5e61ac1a7bb4bc39083eb37464eed", "ja": "伊織ってば、最初はあんなに先生役を嫌がってたのに。\nいざ始まったら、ノリノリなんだから。", "zh": "伊织一开始明明那么讨厌当老师的。\n真要开始了，却又兴致勃勃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f62e5b720ef11dacb5fd3a5c8da4bad87b7e2bc7588510209398dc5060351b44", "ja": "伊織のいいところだな。\nいざやると決まったら真剣というか。", "zh": "这就是伊织的优点啊。\n一旦决定要做，就会认真起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "ca274a77ab3df4a661e631943868793729ec4219fb44f396c9a83b8b39313df6", "ja": "当然でしょ！\nやると決めたからには、徹底的にやらないとね。", "zh": "那是当然！\n既然决定要做，就得彻底做好才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "e78a989ad320bc9d04274ea1034564dfad022b940c3973deca03a00e1ca4e8d8", "ja": "真と亜利沙も、静香たちが終わったら徹底的に\nしごいてあげるわ。覚悟しておきなさいよ、にひひっ♪", "zh": "真和亚利沙也一样，等静香她们结束后，我会彻底训练你们的。做好心理准备吧，嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "32021956d32b7149dd2f7110dc0da0b0f4e8610a313c3872b56d834aff715e76", "ja": "ひ、ひええ……！\nありさに、できるんでしょうか……！", "zh": "呜、呜哇哇……！\n亚利沙真的能做到吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "4a422c6a61319ed329e71da6b1e6d859e29912c7f47409bf1ee9551740b31e0c", "ja": "ボクもできる限りサポートするから、\n一緒にがんばろう、亜利沙……！", "zh": "我也会尽力支持你的，\n一起加油吧，亚利沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "13612dbc7bb278b5b38b55c4b69eb4971dd37b9dc8853bbdb2501a5127650df0", "ja": "（スパルタではあるけれど……この短時間でも、\nみんなだいぶ良くなっているように見えるな）", "zh": "（虽然训练方式很斯巴达……但就这么短的时间来看，大家好像都进步了不少啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "621191589a916c37f96bc168a0b22cf3cd936b78257d46f71c0b2bb59821925b", "ja": "ふぅ……いったん休憩にしましょうか。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "呼……先休息一下吧。\n大家，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "6dd0d20c0b4565d5b39b6373952958cd4ce13605c34d940a200e82a39de44bef", "ja": "つ、疲れた……まだ立ち姿しかやっていないのに……\nこの後、テーブルマナーもやるんだっけ？", "zh": "累、累了……明明还只练了站姿……\n接下来还要学餐桌礼仪来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "6eae858ab5ff71cb75e83b1d9349efdbcb0e7b3cd6067d543b2bc8f5e444e4c0", "ja": "言ったでしょ、やるからには徹底的にって。\nそれに、覚えておいて損はないと思うわよ？", "zh": "我说过的吧，既然要做就要做彻底。\n而且，这些东西学了也没什么坏处吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "67e3513d9a9da4fe3abadafb77d6b374e545638fd9ef6956889ab666ab67f618", "ja": "それにしたって、覚えることが多くて\n頭がパンクしそうだよ～。", "zh": "不过话说回来，要记的东西也太多了，脑袋都快要爆炸了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "52690db1031108e6406d53c0989669bc84496f7e45cc6cb616637c7bfccdef9e", "ja": "はい……役作りのことはいったん忘れて、今日は立ち振\nる舞いを学ぶことに、集中したほうがいいのかな……。", "zh": "是的……先暂时忘掉塑造角色的事，今天还是集中学习举止礼仪比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0ded69bb3210e08f74c41ec5c17f6db2f2648fe95fc62fc7ae5672491b1e5702", "ja": "だったらそれぞれ、目標を決めてみたらどうだ？\n「どんなお嬢様になりたい」とか。", "zh": "那样的话，要不要分别定下目标？\n比如“想成为怎样的大小姐”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0a02534a52b53f55873070a15371e4125f50f8f5a5aa1420c001605f1b970d41", "ja": "その方がモチベーションも上がって、\nやる気が出るんじゃないかな。", "zh": "这样动力也会提升，应该就更有干劲了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "c0518bec4ee68b6110febb053b6a40218129cfe715b61457896b2f07a89a6d9c", "ja": "いいんじゃない？　アンタにしては、\n使えるアドバイスだと思うわ♪", "zh": "这样不是挺好吗？对你来说，这应该算是个派得上用场的建议吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "054c21b05058576247c81fabca5fd4d73452b2f9b4db2ae107e9eafe6ff3f7c1", "ja": "理想のお嬢様かぁ～。やっぱり、キラキラしてて……\n歌で、動物たちとお友達になれちゃうとか！？", "zh": "理想中的大小姐啊～果然应该是那种闪闪发光的……还能通过歌声和动物们成为朋友之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "2e8b1450ec8baffed61fba1a477cfdb8c6c7863ce2c126f19658e9a27f91a8f0", "ja": "それは……お嬢様というより、\n物語のプリンセスとかじゃない？", "zh": "那与其说是大小姐，不如说是故事里的公主吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "f1935039a9ad117a180155d43ff45549841d3cf6095efc3c661483ba25feea6b", "ja": "あ、そっかぁ……あはは。\n静香ちゃんは、どんなお嬢様になりたい？", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……啊哈哈。\n静香想成为怎样的大小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b6faab31de456c9eb74c1c80798e6cc5cf9001420e2bb5ede48809442a5f48b", "ja": "私は……そうね。\n誰からも愛されるようなお嬢様、とか……？", "zh": "我……应该说，是想成为人人都喜欢的大小姐吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "a94197d922f9c7552fd470495d23c84c7279e8d42fc7f9d4eb7fb3060e4b78f8", "ja": "ボクはやっぱり、お姫様みたいなお嬢様がいいなぁ！\nカワイイドレスをいっぱい持ってたりして……♪", "zh": "我果然还是更喜欢公主一样的大小姐呢！\n比如拥有好多可爱的礼服……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "5398267a5325fb358b5df1606df39cceedd33a8d5133f7783b4a5a66b4369a62", "ja": "今回は、ドレスの出番はないですけど。\nでも、いつか役に立つかもしれないし！", "zh": "这次虽然没有礼服登场的机会，\n但说不定哪天就能派上用场呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "80878024a63484905077dba58a4ca0a0b0dc4eab11736592fbd64c4e6f451c24", "ja": "そうだな。亜利沙はどうだ？\n今回は、王子様役だけど。", "zh": "没错。亚利沙觉得怎么样？\n这次要演王子哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "877857abad6613fedb502df38743e4b3cbc898ded0c445dbbb9ff98721355b68", "ja": "それなんですけど……。\nありさ、ひとつ気になってるコトがあって。", "zh": "就是这个……  \n人家有一件在意的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "5e4fabb32ade1a4d823042fa5c9c5cd732b20ae28d1e7e975bef130c780b209a", "ja": "シトリムって、王子様ですよね？\n王子様って、その、すごく優雅ですよね……？", "zh": "シトリム是王子吧？\n王子什么的，那个……非常优雅吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad084f01490427e02d45058e8916dee7a33d47c8908ffdcba0685b929a70e13e", "ja": "まぁ、そうね。私はもちろん、ここにいる誰より、\n亜利沙のシトリムが一番優雅に見えないとかしら？", "zh": "也是呢。不仅是我，亚利沙饰演的西特林\n要是看起来不能比在场的任何人都更优雅，那怎么行呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "44083ae5f052ae66b2f5d349defadbfd643effaaaf59f125423babc0b9cf4033", "ja": "い、伊織ちゃんより……ううっ！\nまたもやプレッシャーが！", "zh": "比伊织还……呜呜！又有压力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "496bdd364be20c7d9f0243b0c5dd191c2db00e1916ef6a175408c6e43566b8e1", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ、亜利沙！　さっき練習してた\nシトリムのセリフもカッコよかったし！", "zh": "没、没事的，亚利沙！你刚才练习的希特里姆台词也很帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "273dfada780d964de9238b786fcd3b5c430f2e0515016048e0df581cf50be50b", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}！\n亜利沙の王子のセリフ、すごくよかったんですよ！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}！\n亚利沙演王子的台词，真的特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b8afbf189342c4676de401b83b95da70cae44e06d52f87b13811270f34d38c2b", "ja": "そうなのか？\n亜利沙、良かったらやってみてくれないか？", "zh": "是这样吗？\n亜利沙，如果你愿意的话，能不能试着演一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "2f638f2a50934d0f03578037ab16da21b08358dbde6a517ec2f107f91c6bb4eb", "ja": "うえっ！？\nで、では、僭越ながら……コホン！", "zh": "呃！？\n那、那么，就由我来献丑了……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "38956eebf784ae17d7906893ce556538b1b39a324d3936ddfe7cca8c2e55c7fc", "ja": "「君、どうしてそんなところに……泣いているの？\nさぁ、こちらへ。この手を取って……」", "zh": "「这位小姐，你怎么会在那种地方……在哭吗？\n来，到这边来。牵起这只手……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "c6433cb33a479a8c3fd7225972f1abb7a5a233ae748dc94434cc733b1ec6a114", "ja": "「数多の星の煌めきより、今は君の笑顔が見たい。\n……僕と、踊っていただけませんか？」", "zh": "「比起繁星的璀璨，此刻我更想见到你的笑颜。\n……请问，能与我共舞一曲吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "fcd301cab9f4db791c37c0d046d77df1c5974294b3513f6d2c980648a5e30c57", "ja": "お、おぉー！？", "zh": "喔、喔喔～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "fcd301cab9f4db791c37c0d046d77df1c5974294b3513f6d2c980648a5e30c57", "ja": "お、おぉー！？", "zh": "喔、喔喔～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1045_007ior", "source_sha256": "1754df67a19f1c8e00a6ce3dfc8c1bf619750785642e49bfbe1258fed14b2e83", "ja": "あら……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "aec0ff9205a9ba181e148bc2c4f3a8c0583fb48b1bd469aafbb356442ef46dad", "ja": "おお……いいじゃないか、亜利沙！\nしっかり王子様できてるぞ！", "zh": "哦……不错嘛，亚利沙！\n王子殿下演得很像样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "cbc8737d4614b195d174c90eb14e33206a4d8ad53054b853df5924e329203dbb", "ja": "ね！　亜利沙、カッコいいですよね！？\nボクも一瞬、本気でドキッとしちゃったもん！", "zh": "对吧！亚利沙很帅气吧！？\n我刚才有一瞬间真的心动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "34c7cfdeb06e376f8ac396f2b2308e8a4124dd5526e541c3de7700a7aba012be", "ja": "私も、思わず声が出ちゃいました！\n亜利沙さん、すごいです！", "zh": "我也不由自主地喊出声了！\n亚利沙小姐，太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "dcee982e7d2a240ff7ef1ff197c22c4ef1ec96e28d801f16c6d9df6b2fad7d1c", "ja": "え、えへへ……。", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1050_006mak", "source_sha256": "e2294500f7e6462f27435ed48f4df5690a794c0d999b922d7123138bbc322a00", "ja": "亜利沙に負けてられないな……よーし！", "zh": "不能输给亚利沙啊……好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1051_006mak", "source_sha256": "02d8dbe27a683c986d3dd81bc391f8c0ed5be7bbf04100fc03546af902f23835", "ja": "ボクも、亜利沙やみんなのことを、ドキッと\nさせられるようにがんばるから！　見ててね！", "zh": "我也会努力让亚利沙和大家为我心动的！看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1052_028ari", "source_sha256": "b9223470c5031da3dca3c8ddaebed3a97dfabae3729a88762a39cabe8c2b601d", "ja": "うぇぇ！？　ちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいっ！\n真くんのそれは、こ、心の準備が～……！", "zh": "诶诶！？等、请等一下！\n真同学的那种杀伤力，亚、亚利沙还没做好心理准备～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "f7f63226f03e5a65eb90c302996c1ed29de8b85016289d79a866a90b863d4ac4", "ja": "(みんなのモチベーションは高まっている。\n撮影もこの勢いのまま、上手くいくといいな)", "zh": "（大家的干劲都上来了。\n希望拍摄也能保持这股势头，顺利进行啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
